OL,3,GNEWSA'Parrot experience' up before
OL,4,Aplanners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition against plans for a 'parrot
OL,7,Fexperience' in a former ice-cream shop
OL,8,Fhas been signed by more than 16,000
OL,9,Fpeople.
OL,11,FBlackpool Council is due to discuss the
OL,12,Fapplication for the attraction on
OL,13,FTalbot Road later.
OL,15,FApplicant Przemyslaw Antonowicz wants
OL,16,Fto create a jungle-themed area where
OL,17,Fvisitors can interact with free-flying
OL,18,Fbirds.
OL,20,FAnimal rights organisation PETA, which
OL,21,Flaunched the petition, has raised
OL,22,Fconcerns about animal welfare.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
